  "body": "Set within the highly regarded Ara Hills community, this beautifully finished five-bedroom home delivers modern comfort, generous proportions, and an easy-care lifestyle. Thoughtfully designed across two levels, it's an ideal choice for families, professionals, or anyone seeking a refined, low-maintenance home in a quality neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nPositioned on approx. 453m² of freehold land and offering a substantial 251m² floor area, this home is warm, well-finished, and cleverly arranged, and offers spaces that work beautifully for different living needs.\r\n\r\nEntry Level Offers:\r\n*  Two spacious bedrooms\r\n*  A private lounge perfect for teens, extended family, or guests\r\n*  Full bathroom\r\n*  Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\nUpper Level Offers:\r\n*  Three additional bedrooms, including a well-appointed master suite\r\n*  2.5 bathrooms in total (ensuite, family bathroom, and powder room)\r\n*  Expansive open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area filled with natural light\r\n\r\nLight, Space, and Effortless Entertaining:\r\nThe main living hub is centred around a sleek, contemporary kitchen that connects seamlessly to the dining and lounge areas. These bright, open spaces create an inviting setting for relaxed evenings or hosting friends and family.\r\n\r\nLow-Maintenance Living for Busy Lifestyles:\r\nWith easy-care landscaping and modern construction, this home offers the freedom to enjoy your downtime without the burden of heavy upkeep. \r\n\r\nA Location That Works for Everyday Life:\r\nSituated in sought-after Ara Hills, you're close to local walkways, parks, cafés, schools, and key transport links. With Orewa Beach a short drive away, it's a setting that balances community, convenience, and modern living.\r\n\r\nWe'd love to help you take the next step - contact Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252.",
